                "text": "This week I met w/ the @gsbacomm. We discussed the need for robust federal funding for Title I schools, child nutrition, mental health & students w/ disabilities. Congress should continue to be a strong supporter of schools who work hard to provide the best outcomes for students. https://t.co/OdxCrGyweL",
