                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I opposed HR 4821, the FY24 Interior, Environment & Related Agencies funding bill. The bill was an exercise in partisan politics & draconian cuts to funding levels last seen in 1991. Read more in my statement below.\n https://t.co/15jrAZIcrV",
