                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At 10:30am EST, the House Appropriations Subcommittee on Agriculture, Rural Development, FDA, and Related Agencies will hold it's first markup on the fiscal year 2026 agriculture appropriations bill, which funds crucial programs ranging from nutrition assistance, food safety, rural development and assistance to farmers. The draft bill released by House Republicans continues to cut services and programs that help families, farmers, and rural communities and keep them safe!\nhttps://t.co/RvDXN7tiFk",
