                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Right now, Congress is debating on a budget bill that will determine the fate of crucial programs and taxes. Many families and communities will feel the impact of this bill. On Monday, I hosted a workshop at Albany State U and invited the Concord Coalition to moderate an exercise in debating and trying to find consensus on how to try to balance a budget but still account for community needs and priorities. I want to thank everyone from the area who participated, and I appreciate my constituents\u2019 perspectives as we face this challenge on Capitol Hill.",
